  "text": "proprium.dominica-iii-in-quadragesima-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Third Sunday of Lent” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "We beseech Thee, O Lord, graciously absolve us from all guilt and danger, whom Thou grantest to partake of so great a mystery. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
